 "sig": "bb20d7dfa07e",
 "text": "On the night of December first Davis led his men into the dark. Snow lay knee-deep and deeper. The temperature sank far below zero. There was no trail. Some men dozed off on their feet and had to be shaken awake. The battalion steered by the stars and fought small battles along the ridgelines.",
